{"version":1,"content":"<html><body><p>一級方程式賽車相隔 9 年重返馬來西亞雪邦國際賽道，吸引兩大大馬女神林明禎與 Miko 黃潔琪雙雙把握機會親臨現場朝聖。雖然兩人身處同一賽場並以火辣造型大騷纖腰，但雙方入場待遇卻存在顯著階級分別。這場同場對決意外揭露兩位女神獲官方安排極度懸殊觀賽待遇。</p><p>林明禎獲頂級特權直入車隊工作區</p><figure><img alt=\"螢幕截圖 2026-10-07 上午11.39.16.png/2108x2108_q90.png\" src=\"https://imgs.weekendhk.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/10/17913456652088121_2353413646ac5c401ba544.png\"/><figcaption>螢幕截圖 2026-10-07 上午11.39.16.png/2108x2108_q90.png</figcaption></figure><p>黃潔琪止步貴賓室與好友舉杯暢飲</p><figure><img alt=\"mikowong_1791024134_3999721026348245790_1600500.jpg/raw\" src=\"https://imgs.weekendhk.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/10/179134567641313345_13696621706ac5c40d8a63a.jpg\"/><figcaption>mikowong_1791024134_3999721026348245790_1600500.jpg/raw</figcaption></figure><p>兩大女神各自於社交平台分享觀賽體驗</p><p>兩位藝人賽後皆在社交媒體上分享賽事現場照片及激動感受。林明禎形容今次近距離感受賽車引擎轟鳴，心跳直頭「Off The Charts」，並在社交平台發文驚嘆：「震撼到只能用震撼來形容，9 年後 F1 再來馬來西亞了！如此近距離體驗，熱血呀救命啊！」至於身為地膽首次解鎖 F1 現場體驗的黃潔琪，則主要活動於公共賽車展覽區，賽後她亦開心寫下：「第一次 F1 初體驗」。</p><p>網民熱議大馬女神賽場外另類較量</p><p>這次兩大女神同場現身成為賽車場外另類焦點，雙方截然不同觀賽待遇更引發大批網民熱烈討論。有粉絲留意到兩人階級差距，認為進入核心區獨家特權足以反映官方接待規格差異；同時亦有不少網民紛紛大讚黃潔琪造型性感又活力十足，直指她是賽場上最美風景線。群眾針對兩位火辣靚相留言大讚「身段比賽事更火辣」，更有網民留言將兩人魅力與賽場熱度直接相提並論。</p><figure><img alt=\"minchen333_1791027799_3999750600958566759_202698442.jpg/raw\" src=\"https://imgs.weekendhk.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/10/179134568411012797_6726625816ac5c415a3c7c.jpg\"/><figcaption>minchen333_1791027799_3999750600958566759_202698442.jpg/raw</figcaption></figure><figure><img alt=\"minchen333_1791027799_3999751406608738847_202698442.jpg/raw\" src=\"https://imgs.weekendhk.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/10/179134569045583372_20870944916ac5c41b45865.jpg\"/><figcaption>minchen333_1791027799_3999751406608738847_202698442.jpg/raw</figcaption></figure><figure><img alt=\"minchen333_1791027799_3999751429224587009_202698442.jpg/raw\" src=\"https://imgs.weekendhk.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/10/179134569518590509_17506457046ac5c4204d53e.jpg\"/><figcaption>minchen333_1791027799_3999751429224587009_202698442.jpg/raw</figcaption></figure><figure><img alt=\"minchen333_1791027799_3999752568909242686_202698442.jpg/raw\" src=\"https://imgs.weekendhk.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/10/179134569940792836_6091192146ac5c424188cd.jpg\"/><figcaption>minchen333_1791027799_3999752568909242686_202698442.jpg/raw</figcaption></figure><figure><img alt=\"minchen333_1791027799_3999751464968265545_202698442.jpg/raw\" src=\"https://imgs.weekendhk.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/10/179134570327498157_14554296386ac5c4283ae4c.jpg\"/><figcaption>minchen333_1791027799_3999751464968265545_202698442.jpg/raw</figcaption></figure><figure><img alt=\"螢幕截圖 2026-10-07 上午11.37.19.png/raw\" src=\"https://imgs.weekendhk.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/10/179134570772314982_4904930916ac5c42d13965.png\"/><figcaption>螢幕截圖 2026-10-07 上午11.37.19.png/raw</figcaption></figure><figure><img alt=\"螢幕截圖 2026-10-07 上午11.36.23.png/raw\" src=\"https://imgs.weekendhk.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/10/179134572037327873_3148213046ac5c4391cd02.png\"/><figcaption>螢幕截圖 2026-10-07 上午11.36.23.png/raw</figcaption></figure><figure><img alt=\"mikowong_1791024134_3999721565643544625_1600500.jpg/raw\" src=\"https://imgs.weekendhk.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/10/179134572849789184_18322612106ac5c44137cdd.jpg\"/><figcaption>mikowong_1791024134_3999721565643544625_1600500.jpg/raw</figcaption></figure><figure><img alt=\"mikowong_1791024134_3999721105578755297_1600500.jpg/raw\" src=\"https://imgs.weekendhk.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/10/179134573202345661_3105233026ac5c4448e00c.jpg\"/><figcaption>mikowong_1791024134_3999721105578755297_1600500.jpg/raw</figcaption></figure><figure><img alt=\"mikowong_1791024134_3999721038134303912_1600500.jpg/raw\" src=\"https://imgs.weekendhk.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/10/179134573487383856_11943844246ac5c4474a6c0.jpg\"/><figcaption>mikowong_1791024134_3999721038134303912_1600500.jpg/raw</figcaption></figure><figure><img alt=\"mikowong_1791024134_3999721015485011265_1600500.jpg/raw\" src=\"https://imgs.weekendhk.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/10/17913457379744437_19732537936ac5c44a64326.jpg\"/><figcaption>mikowong_1791024134_3999721015485011265_1600500.jpg/raw</figcaption></figure><p>將來還有什麼演唱會值得留意？</p><p>有不少歌手宣布舉辦演唱會，小編為你整合了 香港演唱會2025一覽 ，包含各演唱會優先購票日期、公開售票日期、門票價錢、座位表等，想搶飛粉絲必定要留意！</p><p>香港有甚麼週末好去處推介？</p><p>香港18區都非常值得花時間好好探索，一家大細去暢玩的 親子好去處 、拍拖推介32大 情侶好去處 、落雨必去的 室內好去處 、慶生推薦20大 生日好去處 、新手必備19大靚景 行山好去處 、秋天戶外 露營好去處 …..</p></body></html>","scraped_at":"2026-10-07T04:19:08.257795+00:00","quality":{"score":3,"chars":1455,"images":13,"source":"WeekendHK","fallback":"none"}}